{"id":4480809144,"name":"Granny: Multiplayer","desc":"Welcome to Granny: Multiplayer\n\nGranny keeps you locked in her house, and she will not let you go.\n\nYou and other players are trapped in this house. Work together to find hidden clues, unlock doors, and avoid dangerous traps.\n\nEach chapter introduces new challenges, puzzles, and dangers as you work together to survive.\n\nGood luck!","path":"/game/4480809144-granny-multiplayer","slug":"4480809144-granny-multiplayer","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3cea13a7316f04ea1f115ecb7929cff61622726abd3d01d5ea9a4c6c477e7e08.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5358ec87acee6d93a7755a1d138d8796/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1625,"visitor":923668869,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T15:59:09.417Z","creator":{"name":"PyroIdentity","type":"User"},"script":{"count":28,"freeCount":16,"keyCount":3,"verifiedCount":0},"page":2,"next":null,"total":2,"scripts":[{"slug":"Granny:-Multiplayer-OP-script-remove-granny-Chapter-1-2-26454","_id":"6781412bd69e3b8aae23bc28","title":"OP script remove granny Chapter 1 2","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7844c","gameId":4480809144,"name":"Granny: Multiplayer","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":4480809144},"features":"[+] Removes Granny and Grandpa\n[+] Supports Chapter 1, 2 (Chapter 3 is on the way!)\n[+] In chapter 2 the door CanCollide = false (this means you can pass the security door with out the key)\n[+] Removes Slendrina mother in chapter 1 \n[+] Free source code.\n[+] Keyless!\nPlease, Comment and provide if you had any bugs to make it better in the Future","tags":["game","Granny","Op","Good script","Granny Multiplayer"],"script":"while true do\n    local function removeEntitiesFromPresets()\n        for i = 1, 10 do\n            local presetName = \"Preset\" .. i\n            local preset = workspace:FindFirstChild(presetName)\n            if preset then\n                local locks = preset:FindFirstChild(\"Locks\")\n                if locks then\n                    -- Remove Granny\n                    local granny = locks:FindFirstChild(\"Granny\")\n                    if granny then\n                        granny:Destroy()\n                        print(\"Granny successfully removed from \" .. presetName .. \"!\")\n                    else\n                        print(\"Granny not found in \" .. presetName .. \"!\")\n                    end\n\n                    -- Remove Grandpa\n                    local grandpa = locks:FindFirstChild(\"Grandpa\")\n                    if grandpa then\n                        grandpa:Destroy()\n                        print(\"Grandpa successfully removed from \" .. presetName .. \"!\")\n                    else\n                        print(\"Grandpa not found in \" .. presetName .. \"!\")\n                    end\n\n                    -- Remove SlendrinaMother\n                    local slendrinaMother = locks:FindFirstChild(\"SlendrinaMother\")\n                    if slendrinaMother then\n                        slendrinaMother:Destroy()\n                        print(\"SlendrinaMother successfully removed from \" .. presetName .. \"!\")\n                    else\n                        print(\"SlendrinaMother not found in \" .. presetName .. \"!\")\n                    end\n\n                    -- Bypass Doors within each Preset\n                    for _, child in pairs(locks:GetChildren()) do\n                        if child:IsA(\"Model\") and child:FindFirstChild(\"Door\") then -- Check if it's a model and has a \"Door\"\n                            local door = child:FindFirstChild(\"Door\")\n                            if door:IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n                                door.CanCollide = false\n                                print(\"Door bypassed in \" .. presetName .. \"'s \" .. child.Name)\n                            else\n                                warn(\"Door in \" .. presetName .. \"'s \" .. child.Name .. \" is not a BasePart!\")\n                            end\n                        end\n                    end\n\n                else\n                    print(\"Locks not found in \" .. presetName .. \"!\")\n                end\n            else\n                print(presetName .. \" not found in workspace!\")\n            end\n        end\n    end\n\n    -- Execute the function to remove entities and bypass doors\n    removeEntitiesFromPresets()\n\n    -- Wait 60 seconds before running again\n    wait(60)\nend","owner":{"_id":"66abf415561cb7837af216d7","username":"A_Coder","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"66abf415561cb7837af216d7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":10608,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2025-01-10T15:47:55.899Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":0,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/81a43d226bcf155abd59dc658dc3305c0704fbf4f1274fddf5d2bafc0ececd52.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/4480809144-1736524075823.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/4480809144-1736524075823.png"},"executes":125,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-18T02:17:15.231Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/81a43d226bcf155abd59dc658dc3305c0704fbf4f1274fddf5d2bafc0ececd52.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/4480809144-1736524075823.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/4480809144-1736524075823.png"},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"chang